      "id": "claim_b92a1274660f4750b20846d917691108",
      "statement": "The documented environment uses a FRITZ!Box 6591 Cable modem with DVB-C functionality providing up to 4 IPTV streams accessible by any compatible IPTV client, with an OPNsense firewall placed between the FRITZ!Box and the internal network to segment IoT and other devices and to manage inbound and outbound access rules.",
