      "id": "claim_f5b512ff7cd64266ae76b5b3adf3915c",
      "statement": "The OPNsense port 554 pass rule is configured under Firewall > Rules with Action Pass, Interface LAN, Protocol TCP/UDP, Source LAN network, Destination WAN address, and Destination Ports 554; each OPNsense configuration change must then be saved and applied.",
