    {
      "id": "claim_2de3564140794cd8bbcfc4ea25ebdb5a",
      "statement": "The OPNsense UDP pass rule for RTP media is configured under Firewall > Rules on the interface connecting to the FRITZ!Box with Action Pass, Protocol UDP, Source set to the FRITZ!Box IP address, Source Port Range 5000-5010, and Destination set to the LAN net; without it, OPNsense's default-deny filtering on that interface would drop the inbound RTP streams.",
